∇ name(fn Check)arg;r
 ⍝ Run one check. fn returns 1 or '' for a pass, 0 or a message for a failure.
 ⍝ An error is a failure too.
  :Trap 0
      r←fn arg
  :Else
      r←⎕DMX.(EM,(0<≢Message)/': ',Message)
  :EndTrap
  :If (r≡1)∨(0=≢r)∧0≠≡r
      Passed+←1
  :Else
      Failed+←1
      Say'  FAIL ',name,(0≠≡r)/': ',r
  :EndIf
∇
